# ==============================================================================
# ISLES'26 — what must never reach a public repository
#
# The rule of thumb: this repo holds code and the documentation that explains it.
# Anything that is a weight, a volume, a prediction or a log stays out of it.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights and checkpoints
# The shipped 5-fold ResEnc-M ensemble is several GB. submission/model/ carries
# only a README explaining how to populate it.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.pkl
*.onnx
*.safetensors
submission/model/**
!submission/model/README.md

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Container images and archives
# do_save.sh writes a multi-GB .tar.gz next to the Dockerfile.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tar.gz
*.tar
*.tgz
*.zip

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Imaging data, ground truth and predictions
# No ISLES'26 volume is redistributable. .npz covers nnU-Net's preprocessed
# cases and every cached probability map the sweep wrote.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.npz
*.npy
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.mha
*.mhd
*.raw
*.nrrd
*.dcm

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# nnU-Net working trees
# Set by training/env.sh; they hold raw data, preprocessed cases, checkpoints
# and per-fold validation output. Roots are configurable (ISLES_ROOT,
# ISLES_NNUNET_RESULTS, ISLES_GT), so ignore them wherever they land.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
nnUNet_raw/
nnUNet_preprocessed/
nnUNet_results/
**/nnUNet_raw/
**/nnUNet_preprocessed/
**/nnUNet_results/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scorer output
# Every script in analysis/ writes its result cache next to itself, keyed by
# case ID: sweep_mm3_all5.json alone is ~1.8 MB of per-subject Dice, lesion
# counts and ground-truth voxel volumes for all 1,453 subjects. Those are
# derived from data we cannot redistribute -- a subject roster is still a
# subject roster -- so they are run output, not source. Rebuild them by running
# the scripts; never commit them. No .json is checked in under analysis/, which
# is why the glob is safe to leave this broad.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
analysis/*.json
analysis/official_scores/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The organisers' evaluation module
# analysis/official/eval_utils.py is Ezequiel de la Rosa's and ships without a
# licence header; it is not ours to re-publish (see NOTICE section 3). You have to
# fetch it yourself to run the scorers, and this line makes sure the copy you
# drop in never travels back out with a `git add -A`.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
analysis/official/eval_utils.py

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and run output
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
slurm-*.out
submission/test/output/
sweep_out/
predictions/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Virtual environments
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and operating systems
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
